OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer left in abandoned, freezing
OL,4,Atown without food and water for TV show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer from mid Wales was dropped
OL,7,Finto an abandoned American town with no
OL,8,Ffood, water, electricity or tools for a
OL,9,Fnew series.
OL,11,FApocalypse, which starts on Sunday,
OL,12,Fsees two groups of strangers attempt to
OL,13,Fsurvive in a site usually used to train
OL,14,Fmilitary, with whatever they can find
OL,15,Fwhile competing for limited resources.
OL,17,FIoan Humphreys, from Carno, told BBC
OL,18,FWales he had "zero idea" what he was
OL,19,Fgetting into and was only told it was a
OL,20,Fsurvival show about a month before
OL,21,Ffilming.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
